        f"{facts.law[3]}, 2-cycle (slots, traceless, massive) {facts.law[4]}; "
        f"THE DERIVATION -- ambient cone {facts.law[5]}, pinned sigma "
        f"coordinates ENUMERATED {facts.law[6]}, region dimension "
        f"{facts.law[7]}; the measured C-support is {facts.law[8]} coordinates "
        f"and is exactly the pinned set {facts.law[9]}; region normal form "
        f"{facts.law[10]} and edge-blind {facts.law[11]} at "
        f"{facts.law[12]} distinct sizes; E lives in the FREE shears only, "
        f"disjoint from C's pinned support, at (free-only, measured slice "
        f"width) {facts.law[13]}; criterion vs direct inertia "
